    {{#> mi-overview }}
        <div class="mi-overview__titles">
            <h6>How it works</h6>
            <h2>Go beyond surface-level skincare</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mi-overview__video d-none d-sm-block">
            {{> c-wistia
                id="33syv1nzsz"
                inline=true
                autoplay=true
                hide-panel=true
            }}
        </div>
        <div class="mi-overview__video d-sm-none">
            {{> c-wistia
                id="1ovt3rrmz3"
                inline=true
                autoplay=true
                hide-panel=true
            }}
        </div>
        <article class="mi-overview__text">
            <p>Traditional creams are applied to the skin’s surface, where the skin barrier can limit how effectively active ingredients are absorbed.</p>
            <p>Qure uses ultra-fine, <em>24K gold-plated 0.5 mm microneedles</em> to create tiny microchannels on the skin’s surface. As you stamp, concentrated serums are applied with precision, helping active ingredients absorb more effectively where they’re needed.</p>
        </article>
        <div class="mi-overview__features">
            <h3>6 Target Areas - 1 Solution</h3>
